        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Low Noon: The Gunless Goon</strong>, you’re dropped into a dusty frontier town where everyone brought a gun to the showdown… except you. Built for VR, this goofy western chaos simulator lets you brawl, weave and improvise your way through bullets, bandits, and bad decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clench your fists, feel the music kick in, and try to stay alive as waves of enemies close in. Punch them, parry their some projectiles back at them, and see how long you can survive under the burning desert sun. The longer you last, the wilder it gets—and the more you uncover about why this town wants you six feet under.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤜 <strong>Gunless, Not Helpless</strong><br>Who needs a six-shooter when you’ve got two perfectly good haymakers?<br>Use your fists to knock out outlaws, uppercut sheriffs, and send troublemakers flying across the desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/aebaf897e81d01aaddfba05935393d8f.avif?t=1768885541\" width=864 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Deflect, Parry, Survive</strong><br>Projectiles aren’t just something to dodge—they’re ammo you can send right back.<br>Smack the eagle out of the air, redirect incoming shots, and turn the enemy’s firepower into your own chaotic weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/35ff7c20206628a101ebc78052c4bc72.avif?t=1768885541\" width=896 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>High-Octane VR Western Chaos</strong><br>Made for VR from the ground up: lean, duck to stay alive in-game.<br>Every wave ramps up the pressure with faster enemies, denser fire, and tighter escapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/2431652f755f4e3aaf7a432a030ec8cb.avif?t=1768885541\" width=350 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Endless Showdowns, Growing Story</strong><br>This is a fight for survival, not a quick duel at noon.<br>The longer you last, the more the world reacts—new encounters, tougher waves, and pieces of your story drifting up from the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/652744cf710507fbd97a71c7084f8534.avif?t=1768885541\" width=1146 height=750 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Comically Chaotic Frontier Vibes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized western visuals, over-the-top funny sound effects, and twangy tunes set the stage for pure slapstick mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/9fc605250d4a2368a7dfc1cf9c0791b1.avif?t=1768885541\" width=533 height=190 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Low Noon: The Gunless Goon</strong>, you’re dropped into a dusty frontier town where everyone brought a gun to the showdown… except you. Built for VR, this goofy western chaos simulator lets you brawl, weave and improvise your way through bullets, bandits, and bad decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clench your fists, feel the music kick in, and try to stay alive as waves of enemies close in. Punch them, parry their some projectiles back at them, and see how long you can survive under the burning desert sun. The longer you last, the wilder it gets—and the more you uncover about why this town wants you six feet under.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤜 <strong>Gunless, Not Helpless</strong><br>Who needs a six-shooter when you’ve got two perfectly good haymakers?<br>Use your fists to knock out outlaws, uppercut sheriffs, and send troublemakers flying across the desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/aebaf897e81d01aaddfba05935393d8f.avif?t=1768885541\" width=864 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Deflect, Parry, Survive</strong><br>Projectiles aren’t just something to dodge—they’re ammo you can send right back.<br>Smack the eagle out of the air, redirect incoming shots, and turn the enemy’s firepower into your own chaotic weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/35ff7c20206628a101ebc78052c4bc72.avif?t=1768885541\" width=896 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌵 <strong>High-Octane VR Western Chaos</strong><br>Made for VR from the ground up: lean, duck to stay alive in-game.<br>Every wave ramps up the pressure with faster enemies, denser fire, and tighter escapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/2431652f755f4e3aaf7a432a030ec8cb.avif?t=1768885541\" width=350 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>Endless Showdowns, Growing Story</strong><br>This is a fight for survival, not a quick duel at noon.<br>The longer you last, the more the world reacts—new encounters, tougher waves, and pieces of your story drifting up from the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/652744cf710507fbd97a71c7084f8534.avif?t=1768885541\" width=1146 height=750 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Comically Chaotic Frontier Vibes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized western visuals, over-the-top funny sound effects, and twangy tunes set the stage for pure slapstick mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017350/extras/9fc605250d4a2368a7dfc1cf9c0791b1.avif?t=1768885541\" width=533 height=190 /></span></p>",
